{"abstract":"The Bureau of Industry and Security (BIS) is extending the suspension of the interim final rule (IFR), \"Expansion of End-User Controls to Cover Affiliates of Certain Listed Entities.\" The suspension was set to end November 9, 2026. This final rule extends the suspension through January 10, 2027.","action":"Final rule; stay.","agencies":[{"raw_name":"DEPARTMENT OF COMMERCE","name":"Commerce Department","id":54,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/commerce-department","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/54","parent_id":null,"slug":"commerce-department"},{"raw_name":"Bureau of Industry and Security","name":"Industry and Security Bureau","id":241,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/industry-and-security-bureau","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/241","parent_id":54,"slug":"industry-and-security-bureau"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2026/11/09/2026-22793.html","cfr_references":[{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"732","title":15},{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"734","title":15},{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"736","title":15},{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"744","title":15},{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"748","title":15}],"citation":"91 FR 70789","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"Effective November 9, 2026, the amendments to 15 CFR parts 732, 734, 736, 744, and 748 in the interim final rule published at 90 FR 47201, on September 30, 2025, and stayed on November 10, 2025, at 90 FR 50857, are further stayed until January 10, 2027.","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":["Docket No. 261027-0002"],"dockets":[{"supporting_documents":[],"agency_name":"BIS","documents":[{"comment_count":0,"comment_start_date":"2026-11-09","updated_at":"2026-11-09T08:57:11.257-05:00","comment_url":"https://www.regulations.gov/commenton/BIS_FRDOC_0001-07